{
  "_readme": [
    "HAND-ENTERED UPCOMING MATCHES. OpenDota has no schedule endpoint — there is no way to",
    "fetch future match times, so this file is the only source for them.",
    "",
    "startUtc MUST be UTC ISO 8601 ending in Z. Never put a local time here.",
    "Shanghai (CST, UTC+8) -> UTC: subtract 8 hours.",
    "  10:00 AM Aug 15 in Shanghai = 2026-08-15T02:00:00Z  (= Fri Aug 14, 10:00 PM EDT)",
    "  07:00 PM Aug 15 in Shanghai = 2026-08-15T11:00:00Z  (= Sat Aug 15, 07:00 AM EDT)",
    "",
    "Leave aTeamId / bTeamId out (or null) when the matchup is not known yet; the card",
    "renders as TBD and still shows the time. Use aLabel / bLabel for things like",
    "3–1 team.",
    "",
    "Once a match is actually played, OpenDota takes over automatically and its entry here",
    "is ignored — completed data always beats this file. You can leave old rows in place.",
    "",
    "Team ids are in data/teams.ts. Times and Round 4 pairings were verified against",
    "Liquipedia's TI 2026 Group Stage source on 2026-08-14.",
    "",
    "Round 5 (Valve nodes 52-58) and the Elimination Round (Valve nodes 9-13) were verified",
    "against Valve's league 19719 data on 2026-08-16. The Main Event bracket does NOT live",
    "here — it is a dependency graph, so it lives in data/bracket-topology.ts."
  ],
